    "difficulty": "Hard",
    "question": "For the decomposition of acetaldehyde, the rate constants are measured over 700-1000 K and analyzed by plotting ln k vs 10^3/T as shown: (see diagram). Calculate the activation energy (in kJ/mol) of the reaction.",
