        "text": "77",
        "image": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "D",
        "text": "308",
        "image": ""
      }
    ],
    "correctAnswer": "A",
    "explanation": "Explanation: The slope of the plot of ln k vs 10^3/T is equal to -Ea / (1000 * R). From the graph, Slope = -18.5. Thus, -Ea / (1000 * 8.314) = -18.5 => Ea = 18.5 * 1000 * 8.314 J/mol = 153.8 kJ/mol ≈ 154 kJ/mol.",
    "explanationImage": "",
